          "summary": "The paper integrates an explicit probabilistic-robustness (PR) objective into the generation of universal adversarial perturbations against deep reinforcement learning-based intrusion detection systems, and introduces PX-UAP, which uses explainable AI to shape perturbations under realistic domain constraints. Experiments report that PX-UAP consistently outperforms state-of-the-art UAP methods in attack effectiveness.",
