          "title_zh": "难的是搜索之后：评测网页智能体综合、组织与呈现知识的能力",
          "url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2609.30604v1",
          "source": "arXiv",
          "section": "arxiv_other",
          "organization": "",
          "language": "en",
          "arxiv_id": "2609.30604",
          "summary": "The authors introduce KNOWS, a benchmark of open-ended, long-horizon browser tasks that require agents to research information, synthesize it into artifacts such as documents and spreadsheets, and navigate program interfaces, with each task scored by an evaluator combining deterministic checks and LLM judgments. Frontier computer-use agents score moderately on partial success but fully succeed on fewer than 3% of tasks, and visual-step failures often render the resulting artifacts unusable.",
