          "title_zh": "MVAgent：通过一致条件构建与镜头级策略优化的多智能体视频生成",
          "url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2609.30609v1",
          "source": "arXiv",
          "section": "arxiv_other",
          "organization": "",
          "language": "en",
          "arxiv_id": "2609.30609",
          "summary": "MVAgent is a multi-agent pipeline that builds typed conditioning inputs for a frozen video generator, using spatial grounding, continuity memory, and an orchestrator to keep character appearance, layout, and state consistent across shots. It trains requests with Trunk-GDPO, a shot-level agentic reinforcement learning method, and reports the highest cross-shot consistency and narrative-planning quality among compared methods on ViMax-Bench, with human evaluators preferring it over the strongest agentic baseline.",
